       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose is well above the maximum.\n\n- **Ordered:** 1600 mg four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Usual maximum:** 800 mg per dose and 3,200 mg/day for adults under supervision. For OTC use, the maximum is 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Risk:** This is twice the maximum daily dose. It carries a high risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, three times daily**, a common regimen\n- **1600 mg per day in divided doses**, for example 400 mg four times daily\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the indication and that you've confirmed it. I can enter it with a note documenting that it was intentional. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
